\par\par \b \uc2  INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  won't  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  aggressively. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Raquel Stenzel \par \uc2 458 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1999\par 17:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, Aug 20 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not intend to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market despite the real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  falling to 5-month lows this week, prompting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars for reais on Wednesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell below 1.90 to the dollar in a move it said was motivated by a shortage of liquidity in the market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued falling Friday on worries that Brazil will not pass further fiscal reforms and after Ecuador said it may defer a coupon payment on a Brady bond. \par \par \uc2  This week's slide in the real has been one of the most dramatic since Brazil floated its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in January due to a loss of confidence by the market that the government would be able to maintain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its crawling band system. \par \par \uc2  Luiz Fernando Figueiredo, director of monetary policy at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told Reuters in an interview Thursday that the bank would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively to control the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  calms the market, selling a lot of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it would be having a big influence on the exchange rate...and not leaving players to feel the onus of taking a stance in situations like these," Figueiredo said. \par \par \uc2  He said that the market is learning how to deal with the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  system. \par \par \uc2  "The difference with the old system is that players did not lose money (hedging in anticipation of more loses for the real) and today they can lose," if the real strengthens, he said. "We are seeing that various players are beginning to think that the cost of hedging is very expensive and this is a sign that the system is working." \par \par \uc2  Figueiredo said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday was intended to smooth the functioning of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. But he said that with the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  players can lose money, which is part of the way the system should work. \par \par \uc2  "The money that enters to speculate on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements is the kind of money that helps the system work," he said. \par \par \uc2  Hedging in anticipation of more loses by the real can turn out to be expensive. "That is what a floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is all about...all portfolio decisions carry risks, and these risks may become reality." \par \par \uc2  But the official sought to calm market worries that Brazil will not continue its efforts to control its huge budget deficit. \par \par \uc2  "We want to tell the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market the following: Gentlemen, look at the fundamentals. We are in a completely sustainable situation, we are doing our duty on the fiscal front." \par \par \uc2  ((Brasilia Newsroom, +55-61-314-1193)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8k0280q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
