\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2:Mkt Says Could Enter Again \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1999\par 16:02\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in early trading Thursday, for the second time in as many days, market paticipants said. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman declined to confirm or deny the rumors, pointing out that the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  only confirms \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  once trading has closed. \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entered the market selling dollars when the real (BRR) weakened to BRR1.9250 per dollar, minutes after the opening. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in, asked for spreads from five banks, and (exchange) rates fell quite a bit to around BRR1.9050 per dollar," said a trader in Rio de Janeiro, citing Santander, Itau, and Unibanco as the standouts on the sell side. \par \par \uc2  As liquidity at that point in trading was extremely thin, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needn't have sold large amounts, players said. \par \par \uc2  "The real is weakening again though, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could come in and sell (dollars) again," another trader said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 1350 GMT, the real had slipped back to BRR1.92 per dollar, from the\par strongest point of BRR1.9050 immediately after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par -By Jamie McGeever (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  19-08-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1402GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv8j0045m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
