\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Ends At BRR1.9050/Dlr; Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 1999\par 23:04\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real (BRR) ended weaker against the dollar in turbulent trade Wednesday, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended at a midrate of BRR1.9050 per dollar on a spread of BRR1.9040 to BRR1.9060 per dollar, compared Tuesday's closing BRR1.8970 per dollar on an equally narrow spread. The real had opened at BRR1.88 per dollar, but steadily lost ground, before rebounding back to BRR1.88 per dollar when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  This is the real's weakest point since March 12, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened trading at BRR1.90 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  After the session ended Wednesday, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets selling dollars. This is its first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since May. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entered the market apparently when the real-dollar rates hit BRR1.90. \par \par \uc2  "Capital flows are negative, and international stock markets are falling," said a trader at Banco Icatu in Rio de Janeiro in explaining the real's slide Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  An auction of BRR1.5 billion worth of dollar-linked 'NBC-E' notes didn't ease the pressure. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The market welcomed the placement in itself, but the sentiment is\par still negative," said another trader, noting that the liquidation of the\par papers is on Aug. 30. This means players are exposed to fluctuations for\par over a week.\par -By Jamie McGeever (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  18-08-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2104GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv8i00456\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
