\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bank To Announce  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Juli 1999\par 00:37\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is to inform the market of every occasion it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets immediately after the session in question, a spokesman confirmed late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The spokesman said, however, that neither the amount used nor the point at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be made public. Nor will the bank reveal if it has bought or sold dollars. \par \par \uc2  "The statement will be extremely short and simple," the spokesman said, explaining that the decision - which takes effect immediately - was taken as "part of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's continuing process of increasing the transparency of its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy." \par \par \uc2  The spokesman added that the last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was in May. \par \par \uc2  "It \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times that month, twice buying (dollars), and once selling," he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As part of the revised macroeconomic framework agreement drawn up with\par the International Monetary Fund earlier this month, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has up to $3\par billion available for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during the second half\par of 1999.\par -By Jamie McGeever (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  07-27-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1837EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010826dv7r01a7z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
