\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's cenbank to report on  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 199 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Juli 1999\par 01:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, July 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday it would inform markets if it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, beginning Wednesday, in a new policy designed to foster better transparency. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Brazil...maintaining its stance to carry out transparent \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...announces that it will turn public when it buys or sells foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said however it will not disclose the amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a buy or a sell of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The bank will report whether there was an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or not after the market close, it added. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been discreetly \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market, selling or buying dollars to avoid abrupt swings in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate since the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  real\tab   was free-floated in mid-January.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Monetary Policy director Luiz Fernando Figueiredo told reporters the measure was intended to avoid speculation in the market over possible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 55 11 248 5423, saopaulo.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7r03kj5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
