\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bk Announces Norms For Market  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 1999\par 00:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BRASILIA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday announced norms regulating the use of intermediaries to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets. \par \par \uc2  As of Friday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be allowed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in those markets only through agents previously accredited, said monetary policy director Luiz Fernando Figueiredo. \par \par \uc2  In practice that had been happening, he said, but the measure will provide the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's moves with more transparency. \par \par \uc2  When \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will also have to offer or bid in the market to five intermediaries simultaneously, which didn't occur before. \par \par \uc2  "We're seeking to prevent the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  from skirting this criterion during abnormal situations," Figueiredo said, referring to a bailout package given to Banco Marka SA and Banco FonteCindam SA in wake of the devaluation. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars to these two institutions at below-market rates on a perceived risk of a systemic crisis following the liquidation of Marka. \par \par \uc2  The transaction is on the table of a congressional inquiry committee at the Federal Senate. \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Arai; 