ficantly lower than the gap registered in 1998, which was equivalent to 4.52 percent of gross domestic product. \par \par \uc2  ((-Brasilia newsroom 5561 314-1193, fax 5561 223-5918)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv3o09kmo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
