\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Malan -5: Says  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\uc2  To Be Rare 2H \b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 17:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Fraga said the decision to allow for a free-float will allow for a reduction in the country's current accounts deficit in 1999. \par \par \uc2  As part of the revised IMF accord, Brazil said the current accounts gap would fall to about 3% of GDP in 1999, from 4.5% in 1998. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head said that a large part of the deficit will be financed with foreign investments, adding that short-term capital poses more threats than benefits and won't be needed to "fill holes." \par \par \uc2  Fraga also said that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will become increasingly rare in the second half of the year. He noted that recent \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have only been designed to give liquidity to the market, not to delimit parameters for the real. \par \par \uc2  The revised pact with IMF specified that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may use $8 billion in international funding on local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets through June. \par \par \uc2  Fraga said that the money made available for \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  is sufficient to meet commitments, adding that he doesn't support the implementation of capital controls. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 24-03-99 \par \par \uc2  1636GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3o02bzn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip