\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  to "water"  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  markets-Fraga. \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 23:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, March 8 (Reuters) - Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  intends to use cash from a proposed new loan from the International Monetary Fund to "water" \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and ensure liquidity, the bank's new president Arminio Fraga said on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "It's not our intention to go back to a policy of fixing the exchange rate," Fraga told a news conference. "We have limits in mind, but it's not the moment (to disclose them)." \par \par \uc2  Under the terms of a letter of intent between Brazil and the IMF, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may spend up to $3 billion in March on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to prop up the real, $2 billion in April, $1.5 billion in May and another $1.5 billion in June. \par \par \uc2  The document forecast the real would end the year at 1.70 to the dollar, up from 1.98 now. \par \par \uc2  Fraga said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules would allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to carry over unspent cash from one month to another. The carry-over, however, could not exceed 25 percent of the new month's limit, he said. \par \par \uc2  Furthermore, any foreign borrowing by Brazil's government - excluding \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  involving the National Development Bank (BNDES) and state companies - would be added to the amount of cash the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was allowed to spend. \par \par \uc2  The letter of intent also said \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures from March. \par \par \uc2  ((Brasilia newsroom 5561 314 1193; brasilia.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv3800sx5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
