\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real/End -2: Dealers Cite  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 21:52\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real (BRR) closed stronger against the dollar in calm trade Friday on brighter market sentiment and unconfirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to confirm or deny the rumors. \par \par \uc2  The real ended at a mid-rate of BRR1.99/dollar on a spread of BRR1.98-2.00/dlr, compared to Thursday's closing BRR2.07/dlr on an equally narrow spread. Friday, the real opened stronger at BRR2.04/dlr, and strengthened to as much as BRR1.96/dlr in late trading which tempted some banks to buy dollars, market participants said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the mood at trading tables is brighter after new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Arminio Fraga's pledge Thursday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue its policy of unannounced sporadic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to defend the real. This diminishes the market's ability to speculate against the real, they said. \par \par \uc2  "When the market least expects it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a Sao Paulo \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader, who welcomed the policy. "This is obviously the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  trying to break market expectation on speculating." \par \par \uc2  Players also welcomed Fraga's announcement that future funds from foreign lenders will be used for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  purposes when necessary. \par \par \uc2  "This will increase liquidity, which is good," said a Rio de Janeiro dealer, who noted that lots of up to $50 million were changing hands Friday, against recent traded lots of a maximum $5 million. He also said several banks - both local and foreign - were actively trading. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  05-03-99 \par \par \uc2  2052GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv350021a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
