\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real/Midsession -2: Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  - Dealers \b0\par\par\uc2 202 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 17:41\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real (BRR), is trading slightly stronger against the dollar in calm trade at midsession Thursday, on unconfirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to confirm or deny the rumors. \par \par \uc2  At 1610 GMT, the real was quoted at a mid-rate of BRR2.11/dollar on a spread of BRR2.10-2.12/dlr compared to Wednesday's finishing BRR2.13/dlr. The real had opened stronger at BRR2.12/dlr, before weakening to around BRR2.14/dlr. This is when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entered the market selling small lots of dollars, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading is really calm, and liquidity is low," said a Sao Paulo \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. He said that unlike recent sessions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the futures market yet Thursday. \par \par \uc2  April dollar contracts were trading lower at around BRR2,090.00 (per $1,000), compared to Wednesday's closing BRR2,154.19. \par \par \uc2  Trading resumes in earnest at around 1800 GMT, when most dealers return from lunch. \par \par \uc2  -By Jamie McGeever; (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  04-03-99 \par \par \uc2  1641GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv34001yz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picsca