\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk/Rates -4: "Classical"  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Policy \b0\par\par\uc2 408 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 21:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Fraga said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't set targets for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates. \par \par \uc2  In late trading Thursday, the real (BRR) was at BRR2.09/dlr, compared to a closing mark Wednesday of BRR2.14/dlr. The real has given up 42% of its value since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  first eased controls on exchange rate fluctuations in mid-January. \par \par \uc2  Fraga said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  occasionally in the exchange market, adding that \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stance with respect to \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be "classical," and similar to policies in place in other countries. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "If there's a lack of liquidity or volatility, we'll \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , just\par as other countries do," Fraga said. "In a free-float exchange regime,\par the need for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is part of wider policy framework\par "\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last week confirmed that it had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the\par exchange market as the expiration of futures contracts placed heavy\par pressure on the real. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 monetary authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has also been rumored to\par have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  this week, as the real hit its lowest mark ever, but\par hasn't confirmed or denied the reports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The new \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  president said \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  won't adopt an \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par policy similar to the one in place in Mexico, where the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par auctions dollars whenever the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  moves more than 2%. But he said\par "the goals are similar."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Fraga said Thursday that Brazil will use a portion of recently-granted\par international aid to provide liquidity to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In December, Brazil received $9.4 billion in funding as part of a\par $41.5 billion aid package coordinated by the International Monetary\par Fund. Brazil and the IMF are expected to unveil the revised terms of the\par credit line within the next few days, paving the way for a second\par tranche of about $9 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Fraga said that the international funding will also be used in the\par coming months to finance debt obligations, noting that Brazil's debt\par profile is more short term than long term.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We aim to gradually change this, which will be done when fiscal\par stability, lower inflation and foreign investor confidence all return,\par which is a gradual process," Fraga said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He completely discarded the possibility of Brazil declaring a\par moratorium, saying: "Default doesn't even exist in our vocabulary."\par -By Adriana Arai; Stephen Wisnefski; Jamie McGeever and\par  Mara Lemos; (5511) 813-1988\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-03-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2013GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3401rbk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
