\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real-2:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Has No Comment On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 21:58\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRR) ended stronger against the dollar in illiquid trade Wednesday following two reported \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, dealers said. The monetary authoritory declined to confirm or deny the rumors. \par \par \uc2  The real ended at a mid-rate of BRR2.14/dollar on a spread of BRR2.13-2.15/dlr, compared to Tuesday's closing BRR2.16/dlr on a similarly narrow spread. Wednesday, the real opened stronger before sliding to a weak point of BRR2.20/dlr in early afternoon trade. The second, heavier \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action in late trading prompted the rebound. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said Wednesday's trading was calmer than Tuesday, but that real-dollar rates only came down after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action, which they said was via the federally-run Banco do Brasil. \par \par \uc2  "In morning trading, it (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to contain fluctuations, but in the afternoon it sold more dollars at ever-decreasing rates, which brought the price down," said a Rio de Janeiro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the volume of transactions on interbank trading was weak. \par \par \uc2  "It's hard to say for sure, but it's probably less than the $200 million registered at the same time yesterday," said a Sao Paulo dealer. \par \par \uc2  Players expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily average rate, or Ptax, to be around BRR2.16-2.17/dlr. Tuesday's Ptax was BRR2.1304/dlr. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  03-03-99 \par \par \uc2  2058GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv33001xw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
