\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil Cenbank sells dlrs at 2.10 reais - traders. \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 15:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, March 2, (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market early Tuesday, selling dollars to keep the real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from sliding again after a 5 percent drop on Monday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars at 2.10 reais through dealers, they said. But the dollar strengthened above that level and was offered at 2.13 reais at around 1100 local/1400 GMT, the same price as at the opening. \par \par \uc2  "The dollars the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold were not sufficient to bring the price down, and if it does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, the market should continue to push up the price," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  The real slumped to a record-low close on Monday of 2.15 per dollar on both a shortage of dollars in the illiquid market and large foreign debt obligations, traders and economists said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it had done several times last week. \par \par \uc2  The market is expecting the top \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  to firm up a strategy to avoid volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets after the new \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Arminio Fraga's Senate confirmation process concludes with a final plenary vote Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 55 11 248 5537)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv3203d82\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
