\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  cenbank to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  less in futures - Fraga. \b0\par\par\uc2 374 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 22:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Feb 26 (Reuters) - The president-designate of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market would diminish now that the government has allowed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, to float freely. \par \par \uc2  "Regarding the issue of selling dollars in the (BM&F futures and commodities) market, I believe that with the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime, such \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would certainly diminish," Arminio Fraga said during his confirmation hearing before a Senate committee. "The market will now determine the exchange rate." \par \par \uc2  Before the move to a free-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in mid-January, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders, would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar futures market, selling or buying contracts to maintain the real/dollar exchange rate within a set band, called the mini-band. \par \par \uc2  But the government scrapped the mini-band on Jan. 13 in its attempt at a controlled devaluation. The bank replaced the mini-band with a new and wider maxi-band, which it was forced to abandon two days later and allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to float freely. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not have any obligation to the level of exchange rate now. The obligation is with the inflation rate," Fraga said. \par \par \uc2  Even so, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Tuesday began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to reduce volatility. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it was selling dollars through particular dealers to calm down markets that were nervous ahead of a futures contract expiration. Fraga made no comment on this issue. \par \par \uc2  Fraga was expected to take over the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  next week when he is finally confirmed by a full vote in the Senate. On Friday, the Senate Economic Affairs Committee voted in favour of confirming the former top aide to financier George Sorgos after a six-hour hearing. \par \par \uc2  The government's economic team, meanwhile, is in the final phase of a negotiation with the International Monetary Fund (IMF) to come up with new economic targets for the battered Latin American nation. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders expected a new \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy would become clear once Fraga stepped in and the IMF mapped out economic goals. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 55 11 248 5423)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv2q03ny8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
