ational funding of about $9 billion before the end of March. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's current reserves figure is down from $44.56 billion at the end of 1998 and more than $70 billion last July. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1930GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2q01jby\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
