\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  -2: Real At BRR2.03/Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 20:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is strongly suspected of having \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in late trade Friday, according to market participants, reflected in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would neither confirm nor deny the rumors. \par \par \uc2  At 1940 GMT, the real (BRR) was trading at a mid-rate of BRR2.03/dollar on a spread of BRR2.0250-BRR2.0350/dlr, compared with BRR2.0650/dlr on an equally narrow spread around an hour earlier. The real had opened at BRR2.05/dlr against Thursday's finishing BRR2.04/dlr. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold through at least two banks about 30 minutes ago," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. Another dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent around $15 million. \par \par \uc2  As reported earlier, traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  waded deeply in the futures market, dealing in April dollar contracts. \par \par \uc2  "It's trying to show that nobody's going to speculate on April contracts, like February and March," said the second dealer. \par \par \uc2  Trading closes shortly. \par \par \uc2  -By Jamie McGeever (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS  02-26-99 \par \par \uc2  02:58 PM \par \par