\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real Ends -2: Unconfirmed Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 21:56\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRR) ended stronger against the dollar Friday in a news-filled session, following unconfirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in late trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  With the market keeping close tabs on news from three fronts, the real ended at a mid-rate of BRR2.0350/dollar on a spread of BRR2.03-2.04/dlr, compared to Thursday's closing BRR2.05/dlr on a wider spread of BRR2.04-2.06/dlr. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily average rate on which all forward contracts are based, known as the Ptax, will be announced later Friday, but dealers expect a rate of around BRR2.0650/dlr. \par \par \uc2  The Ptax will be used as the adjustment rate for March futures contracts, which expired today. \par \par \uc2  Eyes were on a Senate committee hearing in Brasilia, which gave preliminary approval to Arminio Fraga as new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Friday. Fraga's final confirmation will come in a full Senate vote likely to be held next week, but although he is largely welcomed, some market participants are cautious, given his previous links with financier George Soros. \par \par \uc2  "At his first slip, he could slide out of sight faster than (former \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief) Fransisco Lopes," said a Rio \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. Lopes lasted less than three weeks as bank chief after overseeing a disastrous move to free-float in January. \par \par \uc2  "I like him, and this could be a new beginning," countered another Rio trader. \par \par \uc2  Dealers reported \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the spot market just before the close of trading, citing sums of up to $100 million, and heavy-handed involvement in April futures. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment, but a spokesman said there "might be an announcement later tonight." \par \par \uc2  In addition to Fraga's questioning and March expirations, market attention was focused on President Fernando Henrique Cardoso's meeting with 26 of the country's 27 state governors. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  02-26-99 \par \par \uc2  1556EST \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010826dv2q00dwi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
