\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil Real Ends -4: Ctrl Bk Confirms Monitoring  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 23:42\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Late in the day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed it monitored banks' \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market trading tables to prevent banks from clubbing together to push up real-dollar rates ahead of Friday's futures expirations, known as "triangular \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman wouldn't say outright if this translated into direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but said "it's not that difficult to work out." \par \par \uc2  The spokesman quoted the institution's \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  monitoring chief Luiz Carlo Alvarez "confirming that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  monitored the banking system today." \par \par \uc2  The spokesman also quoted interim bank chief Demosthenes Madureira Pinho Neto as saying "we had a calm day," adding that real-dollar rates were "lower than yesterday, and we acted to prevent panic and hysteria, and the day ended calm." \par \par \uc2  This is the third day in the last four the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has admitted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Also late Friday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  released the closing rates of April and May dollar futures contracts. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par April closed lower at BRR2,029.92 (per $1,00) from BRR2,044.13\par Thursday, while May ended at BRR2,045.00 against BRR2,060.00.\par -By Jamie McGeever (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  02-26-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1742EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010826dv2q00dzm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
