what we're expecting Friday," said a Rio de Janeiro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer, citing the futures settlements and other potential market-moving news. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  24-02-99 \par \par \uc2  2048GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument nrg0000020010828dv2o00qfb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
