\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil forex intervention \highlight\uc2  not meant to defend rate. \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 1999\par 21:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Feb 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets over the last two days to moderate volatility and not to maintain a specific exchange rate for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a Finance Ministry official said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "The objective is not to defend any exchange rate, but to reduce the volatility in the market," said the ministry's Executive Secretary Pedro Parente. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been selling dollars in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets since Tuesday to prop up the ailing domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, which slipped to 2.05 to the dollar at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has plunged nearly 41 percent in value since Brazil adjusted and then abandoned a tight \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime last month. \par \par \uc2  Parente told reporters at the American Chamber of Commerce here that the government was not relying on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to restore value to the wobbly real, which he said would move to firmer ground with passage of fiscal reforms. \par \par \uc2  He also said the government did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on instructions from International Monetary Fund officials, with whom Brazil is negotiating to secure the second tranche of a $41.5 billion rescue package. \par \par \uc2  "To say that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions on the exchange rate follow the guidance of the IMF is to underestimate the capacity of the Brazilian government," Parente said. \par \par \uc2  "The move did not have anything to do with guidance from the IMF," he said. ((-Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5420)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv2o03w6b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
