\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  again to prop up real. \b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 1999\par 20:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, Feb 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Wednesday by selling dollars to prop up the ailing domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real. \par \par \uc2  A spokeswoman said earlier the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain sharp swings in the real's exchange rate against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  She later told reporters the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had several times sold small amounts of dollars via dealers throughout the day. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been tiny," the spokeswoman said. \par \par \uc2  The real was trading at 2.03 per dollar late Wednesday, down from an earlier low of 2.04. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lost 40 percent of its value against the greenback since the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  relaxed its stiff \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy on Jan. 13. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the real is not currently under serious assault, but it is under consistent pressure as \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures near their expiry date on Friday and Brazilian firms repay maturing foreign debts which cannot be rolled over. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's foreign cash reserves dipped slightly to a net $35.74 billion Tuesday from $35.76 billion Monday, showing previous \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday had been modest. Wednesday's reserve levels were due to be published Thursday. \par \par \uc2  ((-Brasilia newsroom 5561 314-1193, fax 5561 223-5918)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv2o03w3c\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (brazil near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trle